{
    "_comment": [
        "Synthetic response for GET _apis/discussion/threads?workItemId={id}&api-version=3.0-preview.1.",
        "The content is invented; the shape reproduces what a real collection returns, because that",
        "shape is what the parser has to survive:",
        "  * the file path and line anchor live in `properties`, wrapped as { $type, $value }",
        "  * a review-level thread has no properties at all",
        "  * a file-level thread has ItemPath but no Position",
        "  * a code-block-level thread has both, and PositionContext is RightBuffer or LeftBuffer",
        "  * replies are expressed with `parentId`; root comments omit the field entirely",
        "  * multi-line comment text arrives with real CRLF pairs",
        "  * an author may be missing a displayName"
    ],
